It's a room with lots of monsters, usually including some nasty ones, and
lots of piles of gold.

I stumbled into one yesterday.  My character walks into a big room, I see
all the monsters (including a few gelatinous cubes and rust monsters), and
then I get these messages:
"Welcome to David's Treasure Zoo. -more-"
"The water nymph steals your blessed +2 longsword named Excalibur. -more-"

I got lucky.  I was invisible and had speed boots and good armor (-10 or
so), and I managed to scavenge enough other weapons to keep myself alive
until I found the nymph and took Excalibur back.

